Bug 2056939 - Restore the NVIDIA block-linear modifier with a reduced block height. r=alwu

Older NVIDIA drivers may not expose tiled modifiers for multiplanar YCbCr
images (ImageFormatProperties2 fails), so negotiation collapses to LINEAR.
Restore a same-device arch-specific BL fallback for the copy-path export
buffers, and disable direct decode export in that case so we do not put
DRM-modifier tiling on decode images the query already rejected.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314220


